 is confirmed separately from individual drop assignments. https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/scarlet-monastery-library"}}},{n=S[170],lr="30–40",st=S[83],no=S[14],ba=true,ra={ck=S[139],r={{n=S[550],st=S[68],no=S[72],it={{id=6695,n=S[541]},{id=6697,n=S[609]}}},{n=S[542],st=S[68],no=S[72],it={{id=6689,n=S[569]}}}},t={{id=2039,n="Plains Ring",mob=S[18],st=S[20],no=S[9]},{id=2549,n=S[555],mob=S[18],st=S[20],no=S[9]},{id=3569,n=S[622],mob=S[18],st=S[20],no=S[9]}},no={"Dungeon availability is confirmed separately from individual drop assignments. https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/razorfen-kraul"}}},{n=S[254],lr="32–42",st=S[83],no=S[14],ba=true,ra={ck=S[139],r={},t={{id=7728,n=S[285],mob=S[18],st=S[20],no=S[9]},{id=1992,n=S[245],mob=S[18],st=S[20],no=S[9]},{id=5756,n="Sliverblade",mob=S[18],st=S[20],no=S[9]},{id=7757,n=S[260],mob=S[18],st=S[20],no=S[9]}},no={S[36],"Dungeon availability is confirmed separately from individual drop assignments. https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/scarlet-monastery-armory"}}},{n=S[226],lr="35–45",st=S[83],no=S[14],ba=true,ra={ck=S[139],r={},t={{id=7728,n=S[285],mob=S[18],st=S[20],no=S[9]},{id=1992,n=S[245],mob=S[18],st=S[20],no=S[9]},{id=5756,n="Sliverblade",mob=S[18],st=S[20],no=S[9]},{id=7757,n=S[260],mob=S[18],st=S[20],no=S[9]}},no={S[36],"Dungeon availability is confirmed separately from individual drop assignments. https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/scarlet-monastery-cathedral"}}},{n="The Drowned City",lr="35–40",st=S[151],no=S[26],ba=false},{n=S[357],lr="40–50",st=S[83],no="Level bands are planning guidance, not entrance requirements. that is not a verified equip-level rule.",ba=true,ra={ck=S[139],r={{n="Ragglesnout",st=S[68],no=S[55],it={}},{n="Lady Falther'ess",st="Event encounter not confirmed in Forever beta",no="",it={}}},t={{id=10578,n=S[567],mob=S[18],st=S[20],no=S[9]},{id=10572,n=S[608],mob=S[18],st=S[20],no=S[9]}},no={"Dungeon availability is confirmed separately from individual drop assignments. https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/razorfen-downs"}}},{n="Krol’dok Stronghold",lr="40–45",st=S[151],no=S[26],ba=false},{n="Uldaman",lr="42–52",st=S[83],no="Level bands are planning guidance, not entrance requirements. that is not a verified equip-level rule.",ba=true,ra={ck=S[139],r={},t={{id=9431,n="Papal Fez",mob=S[18],st=S[20],no=S[9]},{id=9397,n=S[628],mob=S[18],st=S[20],no=S[9]},{id=9393,n=S[612],mob=S[18],st=S[20],no=S[9]},{id=9381,n="Earthen Rod",mob=S[18],st=S[20],no=S[9]}},no={S[36],"Dungeon availability is confirmed separately from individual drop assignments. https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/uldaman"}}},{n="Zul'Farrak",lr="44–54",st=S[151],no=S[26],ba=false},{n="Maraudon",lr="46–55",st=S[151],no=S[26],ba=false},{n="Alcaz Prison",lr="48–53",st=S[151],no=S[26],ba=false},{n="The Temple of Atal'Hakkar",lr="52–58",st="Open",no="Sunken Temple is open, and its quests are recorded here: the class quest chains, the entry quests, the Stone Circle chain (Marvon Rivetseeker, Tanaris), Jammal'an the Prophet (Hinterlands), The God Hakkar (Yeh'kinya, Tanaris) and the Essence of Eranikus. Boss drops are not recorded yet. /sgg pins sunken lists every quest giver.",ba=true,ra={ck="18 November 2026",r={},t={},no={"Boss drops are not recorded yet; the quests are."}}},{n="Blackrock Depths",lr="52–60",st=S[151],no=S[26],ba=false},{n="Dire Maul",lr="54–60",st=S[151],no=S[26],ba=false},{n="Lower Blackrock Spire",lr="55–60",st=S[151],no=S[26],ba=false},{n="Blackmaw Hold",lr="55–60",st=S[151],no=S[26],ba=false},{n="Upper Blackrock Spire",lr="56–60",st=S[151],no=S[26],ba=false},{n="Scholomance",lr="58–60",st=S[151],no=S[26],ba=false},{n="Stratholme",lr="58–60",st=S[151],no=S[26],ba=false},{n="Shaper’s Terrace",lr="58–60",st=S[151],no=S[26],ba=false}},professions={{n="Tailoring",b="Cloth armor, bags and reagent bags. Faction Banner, Spinning Wheel and Loom support camps and crafting.",cv="Pairs naturally with Enchanting; buying a tradable craft does not require learning Tailoring."},{n="Enchanting",b="Disenchants unwanted magical equipment and improves gear. Enchanted Lute, Arcane Salvager and Arcane Forge support camp and craft use.",cv="Avoid expensive enhancements on pieces you will soon replace."},{n="Alchemy",b="Mana restoration, caster elixirs and utility potions. Mana Well and later laboratory tools support recovery and recipes.",cv="Ordinary healing potions are First Aid crafts in Forever; discolored Alchemy potions have a different effect."},{n="Engineering",b="Explosives, target dummies and utility devices; later repair and reagent support.",cv="Pairs with Mining. Guns and scopes are not Mage spellcasting upgrades."},{n="Herbalism",b="Herbs and seeds for Alchemy; Incense Candle and gardening tools at camp.",cv="Camp benefits are temporary/shared; do not treat profession knowledge as permanent Intellect."},{n="Mining",b="Ore, stone and metal for Engineering, plus mining camp tools.",cv="Melee attack power from a camp effect is not spell power."},{n="Skinning",b="Leather, hides and scales from eligible beasts; camp tools include Camp Chair and Field Guide.",cv="It does not make leather armor wearable by a Mage."},{n="Cooking",b="Food, drink and campfires; some meals provide buffs.",cv="Use the food tooltip; Mage conjured supplies do not make every crafted buff redundant."},{n="First Aid",b="Bandages, normal healing potions and condition-removal items.",cv="Damage interrupts bandaging; read combat restrictions on cures."},{n="Fishing",b="Fish for Cooking and selected recipes; fishing camp tools.",cv="No guaranteed income or best-profession claim is implied."},{n="Comprehension",b="Mage-specific scroll deciphering through Comprehend Scroll; Study is also listed in the Forever spellbook.",cv="A Mage minor skill, not one of your two primary profession slots. Available from level 6 in the current spellbook."}},gearBrackets={{b="Quest rewards",no="Quest rewards that fit this spec's stat priority, sorted by quest level. The tooltip names the quest, its level, the 